  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skattef&#xF6;rvaltn 2002-2003</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax admin 2002-2003 - Preparation proj tax</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xF6;rberedelsefas f&#xF6;r kommande st&#xF6;d till skatteadministrationen i Laos. Genomf&#xF6;rande part RSV.RSV ska bidra till att st&#xF6;dja Tax Department i att utforma en projektans&#xF6;kan, samt genomf&#xF6;ra tre separata studier/analyser inom policy, HR och organisation/management.En l&#xE5;ngtidskonsult och tv&#xE5; korttidskonsulter ing&#xE5;r i RSV-teamet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation phase for possible Swedish long-term support to the tax administration. Implementing agency RSV.RSV shall assist the Tax Department in the formulation of a project proposal, and also carry out three separate studies within tax policy, HR and organization/management issues.A long-term and two short-term consultants are provided by RSV.</narrative>
  </description>
